{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2019-10-29 22:30:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN NATIONAL CORPORATION APPROVES RAISING THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 1, 2020', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF LINCOLN NATIONAL CORPORATION APPROVED RAISING THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON SHARES TO $0.40 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND REPRESENTS AN 8% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR-YEAR LEVEL. THE INCREASEDDIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK WILL BE PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 1, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JANUARY 10, 2020.'}